        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Silver",
          "audioFile": "werewolf_match_start_necro_werewolf_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/werewolf_match_start_necro_werewolf_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "I've never not been one. Imagine if I asked you how you liked being a human.",
          "duration": 4.733
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Graves",
          "audioFile": "necro_match_start_necro_werewolf_convo02_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/necro_match_start_necro_werewolf_convo02_05.mp3",
          "text": "I'd say that humans are generally awful with moments of surprising compassion and that we would all probably be better off if 90% of us were replaced by cats.",
          "duration": 8.799
        }
      ]
    }
